      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "For more complex structures, writers may find that they require further segmentation of their chapters and scenes. For example, Kaytastic's 27 chapter novel outline divides a story into 3 Acts, and each act is further subdivided into 3 units of 3 chapters each.",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "99deb351-20ea-41d3-88f0-a06d2f74c53e",
